   Given "review×evidence-backfilled-or-absent" is a recurring finding
   class in this studio (L-001, L-008, L-017, L-021), recommend a future
   check rule or convention: an opus whose acceptance criterion is an
   external test command (not covered by root `npm test`) captures one
   green log for that command, same as reds are captured per behaviour.
2. Test 5's name/comment claims "no full reload" but the test does not
